{"story":{"id":"event-preftl-operation-3050","title":{"zh":"[from.spynetwork.leader.GetName]暴露","en":"[from.spynetwork.leader.GetName] Exposed"},"category":"society","kind":"event","image":"art/47bc22d36983ea03d770.webp","start":"preftl_operation.3050","chapters":7,"visible":true,"excerpt":{"zh":"发生了严重违规行为！间谍首脑 [from.spynetwork.leader.GetName]在一次秘访[from.target.capital_scope.GetName]地表时不慎暴露了踪迹。目前事故的细节仍在调查中，但[from.spynetwork.leader.GetHeShe]与当地的[from.target.GetSpeciesName]发生了短暂但直接的接触，他们一瞬间便落荒而逃。我们的特工尽力抓捕目击者，但目前仍一无所获。\n\n[from.GetName]行动仍在进展当中，但我们将采取特殊措施来遏制","en":"A drastic breach has occurred! Spymaster [from.spynetwork.leader.GetName] has been compromised during a clandestine visit to the surface of [from.target.capital_scope.GetName]. Some details remain unclear for now, but [from.spynetwork.leader.GetHeShe] came int"},"tree":{"root":"n0","nodes":{"n0":{"doc":null,"children":["n1"]},"n1":{"doc":"preftl_operation.3050","parent":"n0","via":{"kind":"entry","triggers":[{"zh":"由游戏机制触发","en":"Triggered by a game mechanic"}]},"children":["n2","n3","n4","n5","n6"]},"n2":{"doc":"preftl_operation.3055","parent":"n1","via":{"option":"","optionIndex":0,"delay":[{"days":"14"}],"kind":"option","source":"events/first_contact_dlc_operations_events.txt:2732"},"children":["n7","n8"]},"n3":{"doc":"preftl_operation.3051","parent":"n1","via":{"option":"preftl_operation.3050.b","optionIndex":1,"chance":0.8,"group":"r8870","delay":[{"days":"5"}],"kind":"option","source":"events/first_contact_dlc_operations_events.txt:2772"},"children":[]},"n4":{"ref":"n2","doc":"preftl_operation.3055","parent":"n1","via":{"option":"preftl_operation.3050.b","optionIndex":1,"modified":true,"chance":0.2,"group":"r8870","delay":[{"days":"5"}],"kind":"option","source":"events/first_contact_dlc_operations_events.txt:2790"}},"n5":{"doc":"preftl.10155","parent":"n1","via":{"option":"preftl_operation.3050.d","optionIndex":3,"group":"c8871","delay":[{"days":"3"}],"when":[[[{"type":"other","key":"is_galactic_communi